.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH pepe-compare 1  pepe "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pepe\-compare \- Hold a run\*(Aqs JSON report against an earlier one and say what moved
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpepe compare\fR [\fB\-\-gate\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIBEFORE\fR> <\fIAFTER\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Hold a run\*(Aqs JSON report against an earlier one and say what moved
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-gate\fR
Exit 1 when the verdict is Slower or Worse, for CI
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIBEFORE\fR>
The earlier report (`pepe \-\-json`, `\-\-snapshot`, or a ramp\*(Aqs)
.TP
<\fIAFTER\fR>
The later one, of the same test
